{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 74,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "74:1",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "O you who covers himself [with a garment],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:2",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "Arise and warn",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:3",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And your Lord glorify",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:4",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And your clothing purify",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:5",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "And uncleanliness avoid",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:6",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "And do not confer favor to acquire more",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:7",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "But for your Lord be patient.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:8",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And when the trumpet is blown,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:9",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "That Day will be a difficult day",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:10",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "For the disbelievers - not easy.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:11",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Leave Me with the one I created alone",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:12",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "And to whom I granted extensive wealth",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:13",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "And children present [with him]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:14",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And spread [everything] before him, easing [his life].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:15",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "Then he desires that I should add more.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:16",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "No! Indeed, he has been toward Our verses obstinate.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:17",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "I will cover him with arduous torment.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:18",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "Indeed, he thought and deliberated.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:19",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "So may he be destroyed [for] how he deliberated.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:20",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "Then may he be destroyed [for] how he deliberated.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:21",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "Then he considered [again];",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:22",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "Then he frowned and scowled;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:23",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "Then he turned back and was arrogant",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:24",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "And said, \"This is not but magic imitated [from others].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:25",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "This is not but the word of a human being.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:26",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "I will drive him into Saqar.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:27",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "And what can make you know what is Saqar?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:28",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "It lets nothing remain and leaves nothing [unburned],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:29",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "Altering [i.e., blackening] the skins.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:30",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "Over it are nineteen [angels].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:31",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "And We have not made the keepers of the Fire except angels. And We have not made their number except as a trial for those who disbelieve - that those who were given the Scripture will be convinced and those who have believed will increase in faith and those who were given the Scripture and the believers will not doubt and that those in whose hearts is disease [i.e., hypocrisy] and the disbelievers will say, \"What does Allāh intend by this as an example?\" Thus does Allāh send astray whom He wills and guide whom He wills. And none knows the soldiers of your Lord except Him. And it [i.e., mention of the Fire] is not but a reminder to humanity.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:32",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "No! By the moon",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:33",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "And [by] the night when it departs",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:34",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "And [by] the morning when it brightens,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:35",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "Indeed, it [i.e., the Fire] is of the greatest [afflictions]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:36",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "As a warning to humanity -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:37",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "To whoever wills among you to proceed or stay behind.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:38",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "Every soul, for what it has earned, will be retained",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:39",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "Except the companions of the right,.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:40",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "[Who will be] in gardens, questioning each other",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:41",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "About the criminals,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:42",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "[And asking them], \"What put you into Saqar?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:43",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "They will say, \"We were not of those who prayed,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:44",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "Nor did we used to feed the poor.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:45",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "And we used to enter into vain discourse with those who engaged [in it],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:46",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "And we used to deny the Day of Recompense",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:47",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 47,
      "text": "Until there came to us the certainty [i.e., death].\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:48",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 48,
      "text": "So there will not benefit them the intercession of [any] intercessors.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:49",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 49,
      "text": "Then what is [the matter] with them that they are, from the reminder, turning away",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:50",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 50,
      "text": "As if they were alarmed donkeys",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:51",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 51,
      "text": "Fleeing from a lion?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:52",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 52,
      "text": "Rather, every person among them desires that he would be given scriptures spread about.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:53",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 53,
      "text": "No! But they do not fear the Hereafter.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:54",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 54,
      "text": "No! Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a reminder",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:55",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 55,
      "text": "Then whoever wills will remember it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "74:56",
      "surahNumber": 74,
      "ayahNumber": 56,
      "text": "And they will not remember except that Allāh wills. He is worthy of fear and adequate for [granting] forgiveness.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
